---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Aaron Holmes | Business Systems & Automation"
  description="Business systems automation, CRM architecture, API integrations, workflow design, and applied AI."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero container">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        Business Systems · Automation Engineering · Integrations · Applied AI
      </p>

      <h1>
        I make complicated business systems easier to understand, automate, and
        maintain.
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        I work across business process automation, CRM systems, APIs,
        integrations, and applied AI to reduce manual work, improve reliability,
        and turn difficult-to-maintain workflows into systems people can
        actually understand.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-links">
        <a class="primary-link" href="#experience">Experience</a>
        <a href="#projects">Selected work</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="experience" class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">Experience</p>

      <div class="role-header">
        <div>
          <h2>Business Systems & Automation Engineer</h2>
          <p class="role-company">Lincoln Health Supply</p>
        </div>

        <p class="role-meta">Healthcare · DME · Remote</p>
      </div>

      <p class="role-summary">
        Owned and improved a large healthcare automation environment spanning
        Zoho CRM, Zapier, Zoho Flow, Deluge, REST APIs, webhooks, document
        workflows, and external services. Worked independently with direct
        access to business leadership, translating operational requirements into
        maintainable technical systems.
      </p>

      <ul class="experience-list">
        <li>
          Managed and reverse-engineered a complex production environment with
          hundreds of active workflows, workflow rules, and custom functions
          supporting patient intake, eligibility, prescriptions, documents,
          orders, and follow-up processes.
        </li>

        <li>
          Designed a centralized duplicate-processing system to replace
          scattered duplicate logic, improving consistency, auditability, and
          control over ownership, supplier assignment, and request creation.
        </li>

        <li>
          Built a custom Zapier integration for pVerify eligibility workflows,
          including authentication, token handling, request formatting, and
          normalization of payer and patient data.
        </li>

        <li>
          Built and troubleshot prescription and document fax automation across
          Zoho, document-generation tools, PDF processing, cloud storage, and
          telecom integrations where standard connector behavior was
          insufficient.
        </li>

        <li>
          Led the systems work required to introduce compression garments as a
          new product line, integrating the new workflow into existing intake,
          CRM, request, supplier, and fulfillment processes.
        </li>

        <li>
          Prioritized explicit logging, traceability, and documentation so
          automation behavior could be understood by operations leadership,
          future technical staff, and outside stakeholders rather than relying
          on undocumented institutional knowledge.
        </li>

        <li>
          Trained another employee on Zapier and Zoho workflows and began
          transferring system knowledge out of a one-person technical function.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="projects" class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">Selected technical work</p>

      <div class="project-grid">
        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">Automation architecture</p>
          <h2>Duplicate Processing Redesign</h2>
          <p>
            Consolidated duplicate-handling rules into a more centralized,
            auditable process designed to prevent workflow conflicts and
            preserve intended owner, supplier, and request behavior.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            Zoho CRM · Deluge · Zapier · Workflow Design
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">API integration</p>
          <h2>pVerify Eligibility Integration</h2>
          <p>
            Built a custom Zapier integration for healthcare eligibility checks,
            including authentication, bearer-token handling, API requests, data
            normalization, and CRM workflow integration.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            REST APIs · Authentication · Zapier Developer Platform · JSON
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">Systems integration</p>
          <h2>Prescription & Document Automation</h2>
          <p>
            Built and debugged multi-system document and fax workflows where
            connector limitations, file-access behavior, and integration edge
            cases required custom workarounds.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            Zoho · Zapier · PDF Automation · Cloud Storage · Fax APIs
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="project-card">
          <p class="project-kicker">Product launch</p>
          <h2>Compression Product-Line Integration</h2>
          <p>
            Integrated a new healthcare product category into existing CRM and
            automation processes without rebuilding the surrounding system from
            scratch.
          </p>
          <p class="project-tech">
            CRM Architecture · Workflow Design · Data Mapping · Operations
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills" class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">Technical toolkit</p>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div>
          <h2>Automation & CRM</h2>
          <p>
            Zapier, Zoho CRM, Zoho Flow, workflow architecture, conditional
            logic, data mapping, debugging, run-history analysis, process
            documentation
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>APIs & Integrations</h2>
          <p>
            REST APIs, webhooks, JSON, OAuth concepts, bearer tokens, API keys,
            authentication flows, request/response troubleshooting, custom
            integrations
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>Development & Cloud</h2>
          <p>
            JavaScript, Deluge, Python fundamentals, SQL fundamentals, Astro,
            Git, GitHub, VS Code, Cloudflare Pages, AWS EC2, cloud compute,
            storage configuration, and Linux environments
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>AI & Systems</h2>
          <p>
            Applied AI workflows, LLM tooling, RAG concepts, agentic systems,
            structured outputs, evaluation concepts, system documentation, and
            automation observability
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container">
      <p class="section-label">Earlier work</p>

      <h2>Operations, client communication, and web systems.</h2>

      <p>
        Before Lincoln Health Supply, I built WordPress websites and automated
        document workflows for a financial-services business operating in
        Florida and Singapore. My broader background includes many years in
        customer-facing and operations management roles, which informs how I
        design technical systems around the people who actually use them.
      </p>
    </section>

    
    <section class="section container contact-section">
      <p class="section-label">Contact</p>

      <h2>Interested in automation, integrations, or systems work?</h2>

      <p>
        I am most interested in roles where technical problem-solving,
        communication, and business-process understanding overlap.
      </p>

      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: 5rem 4.5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .section-label,
  .project-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
  }

  .hero-links,
  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .primary-link {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .section {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section > h2,
  .role-header h2,
  .project-card h2,
  .skills-grid h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .section > h2 {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .section > p:not(.section-label) {
    max-width: var(--reading-width);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .role-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .role-header h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .role-company,
  .role-meta {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .role-summary {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .experience-list {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .experience-list li + li {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .project-grid,
  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .project-card,
  .skills-grid > div {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .project-card h2,
  .skills-grid h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .project-card p,
  .skills-grid p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .project-tech {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact-section {
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .project-grid,
    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero {
      padding-block: 3.5rem;
    }

    .role-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .section {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
